## Validation Checklist

Before considering implementation complete:

- [ ] Entity builds without TypeORM errors
- [ ] Input (source) worker compiles and runs in LocalStack
- [ ] Output (processing) worker compiles and runs in LocalStack
- [ ] Orchestrator recognizes new steps in job creation
- [ ] Callback service publishes to Kafka correctly
- [ ] SQS Poller invokes both workers
- [ ] TestOptions fields added to `TestOptionsDto`
- [ ] For fan-out: Failure filter implemented
- [ ] STE passes with new entity (happy path)
- [ ] STE passes with simulated delays
- [ ] STE passes with simulated failure
- [ ] For fan-out: Partial failure test works
- [ ] FK injection works for dependent entities (if applicable)

---

**Remember:** The most common issue is forgetting to update `callback.service.ts` for the new output step. If your job gets stuck with all steps "completed" but job status "processing", check there first!
